    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285250/extras/2e412b10689320833c8d4dbdfb2981c0.poster.avif?t=1676352583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285250/extras/2e412b10689320833c8d4dbdfb2981c0.webm?t=1676352583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285250/extras/2e412b10689320833c8d4dbdfb2981c0.mp4?t=1676352583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u300aJO JO WO\u300b is a joyful multiplayer battle game. The game is divided into three camps: &quot;competitors&quot;, &quot;swearers&quot; and &quot;clowns&quot;.<br>The &quot;Participant&quot; camp successfully completes the task to win, and the &quot;Traitor&quot; camp kills other players to win<br>Players need to complete the assigned camp tasks according to their own camp to win the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285250/extras/21e6e33348a64b3bd14568aec7c2602f.poster.avif?t=1676352583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285250/extras/21e6e33348a64b3bd14568aec7c2602f.webm?t=1676352583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285250/extras/21e6e33348a64b3bd14568aec7c2602f.mp4?t=1676352583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Choose a career:<br>In addition to different factions have different skills, different occupations also have different professional skills, please choose the occupation that suits your camp to help you complete the task.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285250/extras/48136e7d6e52bcd5dbb04ba7dc12581b.poster.avif?t=1676352583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285250/extras/48136e7d6e52bcd5dbb04ba7dc12581b.webm?t=1676352583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285250/extras/48136e7d6e52bcd5dbb04ba7dc12581b.mp4?t=1676352583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>To repair generators:<br>Repair all generators, activate comm stations, and escape!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285250/extras/ea93d1e4fda2f3057d557d38d20f0acf.poster.avif?t=1676352583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285250/extras/ea93d1e4fda2f3057d557d38d20f0acf.webm?t=1676352583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285250/extras/ea93d1e4fda2f3057d557d38d20f0acf.mp4?t=1676352583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Rougelike cards:<br>Rougelike cards will give you different effects, choose the right rougelike card, you will win more easily.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285250/extras/dadf912b37a33660edd643707bbe3ac1.poster.avif?t=1676352583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285250/extras/dadf912b37a33660edd643707bbe3ac1.webm?t=1676352583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285250/extras/dadf912b37a33660edd643707bbe3ac1.mp4?t=1676352583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>vote:<br>Vote for the player you think is suspicious, expel him from the base, and sanction him w